## 📚 ALL LULU TOOLS

### Context Tools (Offline)
- `lulu_get_context` - **USE FIRST!** Complete static context from .lulu/profile.json
- `lulu_list` - List specific category (components, hooks, utils, types, constants, api, stores)
- `lulu_read_code` - Get source code of specific file by name

### Search Tools (Cloud Required)
- `lulu_search` - Natural language semantic search across codebase
- `lulu_find_duplicates` - Check if similar code already exists before creating new

### Generation & Guidance Tools
- `lulu_get_guidance` - Get file creation guidance (where to create, naming conventions)
- `lulu_generate_code` - Generate code following learned patterns
- `lulu_assess` - **MANDATORY after generation** - Quality check (must score ≥80%)

### Intelligence Tools
- `lulu_learn` - Record corrections to improve future generations
- `lulu_stats` - Show time saved, costs, accuracy metrics
- `lulu_discover_mcps` - Find relevant MCP servers for your tech stack

