## ✅ DECISION MATRIX

When `lulu_search` returns results, use this guide:

| Similarity Score | Action | Example |
|-----|-----|---|
| **≥90%** | REUSE exactly | Import and use as-is |
| **85-89%** | REUSE or adapt | Use with minor tweaks |
| **70-84%** | Use as reference | Follow patterns, create new |
| **<70%** | Create new | Follow project conventions |

**CRITICAL**: Similarity ≥85% = REUSE! Don't duplicate existing code.

