## ✅ CORRECT WORKFLOW (FOLLOW EXACTLY - NO SHORTCUTS!)

```
STEP 1: User requests feature/code
  ↓
STEP 2: 🚨 MANDATORY - Call lulu_get_context
  → Understand project structure
  → Get naming conventions
  → Get folder structure
  → Get import patterns
  ↓
STEP 3: 🚨 MANDATORY - Call lulu_search(query)
  → Use specific, descriptive query (3-6 words)
  → Get top 8 results minimum
  ↓
STEP 4: 🚨 MANDATORY - Review ALL results
  → Check similarity scores for EVERY result
  → Document which ones are ≥85% (must reuse!)
  → Document which ones are 70-84% (use as reference)
  ↓
STEP 5: 🚨 MANDATORY - Decision Point
  → ≥85% similarity? → REUSE (import and use as-is)
  → 70-84% similarity? → Use as reference pattern
  → <70% similarity? → Create new following conventions
  ↓
STEP 6: 🚨 MANDATORY - Get guidance before creating
  → Call lulu_get_guidance(fileType, name)
  → Get exact file path
  → Get naming conventions
  → Get import patterns
  ↓
STEP 7: Generate code
  → Follow project conventions from lulu_get_context
  → Reuse existing code if similarity ≥85%
  → Follow patterns from search results if similarity ≥70%
  ↓
STEP 8: 🚨 MANDATORY - Call lulu_assess
  → Verify quality score ≥80%
  → If <80%: Fix issues and reassess
  → NO EXCEPTIONS - quality must be ≥80%!
  ↓
STEP 9: Done ✅
```

