## 🌐 Cloud API Setup

Lulu semantic search requires the Python API:

```bash
# Start services
docker-compose up -d

# Verify health
curl http://localhost:8000/health

# Upload scan data
lulu upload
```

**If API unavailable:**
- Static context (`lulu_get_context`) still works offline
- Semantic search will show clear error with setup instructions
- You can still generate code using static context + code organization rules

